. *==============================================================================
. * SECTION A. NEW ERROR MESSAGES (invalid input that used to give a wrong result)
. *==============================================================================
. 
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. * A1. More allocation ratios than groups
. *     OLD: for >2 groups the extra ratios were ignored in the calculation but
. *          still counted when splitting n between the arms, so n was far too
. *          small: pr(.1 .2 .3) gives n = 231, aratios(1 1 1 5) gave n = 87
. *          (29 per arm), and the table showed the allocation ratio as 1:1:1.
. *          For 2 groups the error was "Invalid allocation ratio".
. *     NEW: error "Please specify the same number of aratios() as pr()".
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. artbin, pr(.1 .2 .3)

{txt}{hi:ART} - {hi:A}NALYSIS OF {hi:R}ESOURCES FOR {hi:T}RIALS (binary version 2.1.3 26nov2026)
{hline 78}
A sample size program by Abdel Babiker, Patrick Royston, Friederike Barthel, 
Ella Marley-Zagar and Ian White
MRC Clinical Trials Unit at UCL, London WC1V 6LJ, UK.
{hline 78}
Type of trial{col 40}{res}superiority
{txt}Number of groups{col 40}{res}3
{txt}Favourable/unfavourable outcome{col 40}{res}not determined
{txt}Allocation ratio{col 40}{res}equal group sizes
{txt}Statistical test assumed{col 40}{res}unconditional comparison of 3
{txt}{col 40}{res} binomial proportions
{txt}{col 40}{res} using the score test
{txt}Local or distant{col 40}{res}distant
{txt}Continuity correction{col 40}{res}no

{txt}Anticipated event probabilities{col 40}{res}0.100 0.200 0.300

{txt}Alpha{col 40}{res}0.050 (two-sided)
{txt}Power (designed){col 40}{res}0.800

{txt}Total sample size (calculated){col 40}{res}231

{txt}Sample size per group (calculated){col 40}{res}77 77 77
{txt}Expected total number of events{col 40}{res}46.2
{txt}Expected number of events per group{col 40}{res}7.7 15.4 23.1
{txt}{hline 78}

{com}. cap noi artbin, pr(.1 .2 .3) aratios(1 1 1 5)
{err}Please specify the same number of aratios() as pr()
{txt}
{com}. cap noi artbin, pr(.1 .2) aratios(1 2 3)
{err}Please specify the same number of aratios() as pr()
{txt}
{com}. 
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. * A2. margin() must lie strictly between -1 and 1 (artbin and art2bin)
. *     OLD: no check. Message "You have found a case that we have never
. *          encountered before! ..." and then a result: n = 2 for
. *          margin(1), and a missing n (".") for margin(-1.5).
. *     NEW: error "Margin must lie strictly between -1 and 1".
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. cap noi artbin, pr(.2 .2) margin(1)
{err}Margin must lie strictly between -1 and 1
{txt}
{com}. cap noi artbin, pr(.2 .2) margin(-1.5)
{err}Margin must lie strictly between -1 and 1
{txt}
{com}. cap noi art2bin 0.2 0.2, margin(1)
{err}Margin must lie strictly between -1 and 1
{txt}
{com}. 
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. * A3. doses() checks (>2 groups, trend test)
. *     OLD: doses(1 2 3 4) silently dropped the 4th dose (n = 186);
. *          doses(2 2 2) gave a missing sample size (".").
. *     NEW: errors "Please specify the same number of doses() as pr()." and
. *          "doses() must contain at least two distinct values."
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. cap noi artbin, pr(.1 .2 .3) doses(1 2 3 4)
{err}Please specify the same number of doses() as pr().
{txt}
{com}. cap noi artbin, pr(.1 .2 .3) doses(2 2 2)
{err}doses() must contain at least two distinct values.
{txt}
{com}. 
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. * A4. ccorrect with nchi (2 groups)
. *     OLD: ccorrect was accepted and the table said "Continuity correction
. *          yes", but it was not applied (n = 124 with and without ccorrect).
. *     NEW: error "ccorrect is not available with nchi".
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. artbin, pr(.1 .3) nchi

